      "options": {
        "content": "# 🎯 EventZilla MLOps Monitoring Dashboard\n\n## Week S13 - Production Monitoring System\n\n**Purpose:** Real-time monitoring of ML API, model performance, data quality, and system health.\n\n**Refresh Rate:** 10 seconds | **Environment:** Production\n\n---\n\n### 📊 Dashboard Sections:\n1. **Traffic & Performance** - Request rates and latency\n2. **Model Health** - Accuracy, confidence, predictions\n3. **Data Quality** - Missing values, freshness, drift\n4. **System Resources** - CPU, Memory, Disk\n5. **Alerts & Errors** - Error rates and anomalies",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.0.0",
      "title": "Dashboard Overview",
      "type": "text"
    },
